 that scene with emu and the photos  we are led to believe that a death  occurred at the reverie as well as an  attempted murder we don't get to see  what exactly happened but we do get to  see the reactions of many people as they  react to the news being reported by the  world economy newspaper by the way this  is news that the world government tried  to hush up but big news morgan's decided  to report it anyway the news is clearly  about sabo at least in part and the  revolutionaries are both saddened and  shocked to learn what happened inside  the goa kingdom the king and queen are  in disbelief and both makino and adan  are in tears the implication is clearly  that sabo may have died off-screen  but this doesn't make much sense why  would oda go through all that trouble of  bringing sabo back and having him  consume ace's devil fruit only to then  kill him off scream i mean that would be  insane it is important to mention that  in the anime in particular this big news  is shown to be especially tragic for the  people of alabasta who are clearly  distraught and in mourning this implies  that whatever happened at the reverie  clearly involves the nefertari royal  family something either happened to king  cobra or princess vivi or both  this suggests that after that scene with  the photos imusama may have made a move  against the nefertaris possibly because  of their connection to pluton if i had  to guess i'd say that cobra may have  been killed and vivi may have been the  victim of an assassination attempt but  she was rescued by the revolutionaries  sabo may then have been falsely accused  of killing cobra and kidnapping vivi but  if that were the case then the alabaster  reaction would make sense but the  reactions of the revolutionaries and  makino and the don don't really fit i  don't think they would be so shocked and  saddened if sabo had made a clean  getaway even if he was being framed for  a terrible crime the only way their  reaction makes sense is if sabo really  did die or if he was actually captured  and arrested for these alleged crimes  and is about to be executed if that  second part is true then it seems way  too similar to what happened to ace but  at the same time this would be a  surefire way to lure luffy into a trap  and force a showdown between him and the  world government so we'll have to wait  and see either way i'm willing to bet  that both sabo and vivi are alive and  that they wouldn't be killed off screen  as far as cobra goes though he was  probably the one who was killed and if  he was killed because of the nefertari  connection to pluton then we have to go  back to those four photos if shirahoshi  is poseidon and vivi is pluton or at  least connected to it in some  fundamental way then could luffy and  blackbeard also be connected to ancient  weapons  the third weapon that we know about is  uranus although its name is literally  the only thing that we know about it and  yes i know that in english uranus is  also pronounced as uranus but since i'd  rather not keep saying that over and  over again i'll just use uranus oh when  people start complaining about this in  the comments then i'll pull a real chat  move and just start using the ancient  greek pronunciation from now on uranos  anyway we know that all three ancient  weapons bear the names of greek gods  poseidon the greek god of the sea storms  earthquakes and horses pluton the greek  god of the earth land and the underworld  and uranus a primordial god who is the  personification of the sky and the  father of the titans i often see people  saying that pluton actually comes from  the roman god pluto but no the word  pluton originates in greek mythology  where it was used as another name for  hades the roman pluto actually comes  from the greek pluton according to robin  even in the world of one piece all three  weapons were named after a god but since  this is a world that is different from  our own these gods may also be different  from the gods we know from ancient  greece that said the uranus from greek  mythology is currently our best hint for  what this ancient weapon might actually  be clearly it is associated with the sky  and the heavens and sky-related things  like rain and wind but what if uranus is  also associated with another celestial  god in the world of one piece the sun  god nika sun god nika is a mythical  warrior who was worshiped by slaves as a  sun deity since ancient times the slaves  prayed that sun god nika would one day  come and liberate them it was later  revealed that there is a mythical zoned  devil fruit called the hitohitomi model  nika which is of course the true name of  luffy's devil fruit the gorosei were  aware of this devil fruit's existence  and the world government has been trying  to capture it for centuries but they  never succeeded it was as if this devil  fruit had a will of its own and like it  was actively running away from the world  government  now it seems that the gorosei didn't  think that the nika fruit was an  immediate threat because it hadn't  awakened in over 800 years the last time  this fruit was fully awakened was all  the way back during the void century and  so the gorosei assumed that as long as  the nika fruit isn't awakened they would  be safe  however the gorosei eventually changed  their approach and they ordered luffy's  immediate execution at the end of  chapter 1043  luffy seemingly dies but he is brought  back to life as his devil fruit awakens  in that moment zunesha proclaims that  joy boy himself  has returned after his devil fruit  awakening luffy unlocks an absolutely  ridiculous new power that allows him to  basically turn reality into toon world  and his power at this point can  definitely be compared with the power of  a god  now the fact that the nika fruit hadn't  awoken since the void century reminded  me a lot of poseidon the ancient weapon  which awakens within a person the  mermaid princess but not every mermaid  princess poseidon only awakens once in  several centuries and the same appears  to be the case for joy boy and the nica  devil fruit and of course pluton hasn't  been seen since the void century either  meaning that just like shirahoshi and  joyboy pluton may be a power that must  be first awakened before it is used and  this is only possible once in several  centuries so what if joyboy is the  ancient weapon uranus and it is only  awakened when multiple specific  conditions are met one of these  conditions is that poseidon must also be  awakened and perhaps pluton as well but  we just don't know that yet another  condition is that the right person must  be in possession of the mythical nika  devil fruit so if the wrong person has  the fruit it will just be the gomu no me  it will not awaken just like it didn't  for 800 years there might even be some  connection to the d-clan  maybe the nika devil fruit must be in  possession of a member of the d-clan in  order to awaken and if it isn't then it  simply won't work just like poseidon  only awakens within members of the  ryugyu royal family and just like pluton  is likely connected to the nefertari  royal family uranus could be connected  to the d-clan this would explain why the  d-clan are considered to be the natural  enemies of the celestial dragons  technically anyone from this clan could  activate uranus under the right  circumstances and if uranus poseidon and  pluton are all activated at the same  time they would likely have the power to  destroy the world government and  overthrow the celestial dragons and this  would certainly explain why the gorosei  suddenly decided that luffy must be  killed at all costs he had to be killed  before his devil fruit awakened and joy  boy aka uranus was activated and if  joyboy really is the ancient weapon  uranus it would lend further credence to  the theory that the artificial devil  fruits known as smiles were an attempt  to recreate the nica mythical zone devil  fruit which is of course a key  ingredient in activating the joyboy  ancient weapon after all 90 of those who  consume a smile devil fruit end up as  failures not only will they not receive  any special power from the fruit but  they will be condemned to laugh  uncontrollably for the rest of their  lives knowing how joy and laughter is  associated with the nika devil fruit  it's almost like these failures become  dark and inverted versions of the true  joy boy so is this the missing piece  are joy boy and son god nika synonymous  with the third ancient weapon uranus if  this were the case then three of the  photos that imusama had in her  possession were related to ancient  weapons shirahoshi is poseidon vivi is  pluton or she is the only one who can  activate it due to her royal bloodline  and luffy is uranus but then what about  the fourth photo blackbeard one argument  could be that maybe uranus once  activated has an effect on every single  d-clan member not just luffy so maybe  they will all become stronger now  including blackbeard but if that was the  explanation then surely dragons in lost  photos would have been there as well i  think that the reason why blackbeard's  photo was included is directly related  to rox d zepic and god valley the god  valley incident was a major event that  took place 38 years ago and the truth  about what happened was strictly hushed  up by the world government today only  the older generations of marines are  even aware of this incident rox d zebek  who is considered to be perhaps the  greatest rival of goal d roger had  assembled an incredibly powerful pirate  crew that consisted of a young  whitebeard kaido and big mom among other  heavy hitters together with this crew  zebek declared war against the world  government and he set out to make  himself the king of the world which  means that he was determined to straight  up overthrow the celestial dragons the  rocks pirates were infamous and fearsome  and they were clearly a massive threat  to global stability one day 38 years ago  zebek and his crew attacked a remote  island known as god valley in chapter  957  sengoku gives us a quick overview of  what happened and it seems that at the  time of zebec's attack multiple  celestial dragons were present on the  island of god valley sengoku doesn't  specify how many celestial dragons were  present or which ones were actually  there we just know that some of them  were on the island along with their  slaves  it is possible that these were  high-ranking world nobles such as the  gorosei because in order to defeat zebek  and to protect the celestial dragons the  world government resorted to an  unprecedented act they agreed to work  together with gold d roger in order to  take zebic down garp and roger did the  heavy lifting in this fight and after  zebek was defeated the rox pirates were  dissolved the truth about this entire  incident was then heavily censored by  the world government and the island of  god valley itself vanished from the face  of the earth we don't know how or why it  vanished but now it is gone and it  cannot even be found on any map by the  way it's important to state that this  wasn't an instance of the world  government calling in a buster call to  blow up everything on the island in  sengoku's own words the island wasn't  blown up with a buster call the island  disappeared entirely this is creepy but  also intriguing okay so knowing what we  know about the god valley incident what  is the missing piece here what were  high-ranking celestial dragons doing on  some remote island in the middle of  nowhere these people never seem to stray  far from their holy land unless  something drastic occurs so what drove  them to visit god valley furthermore why  would zebec attack this one island  rather than taking the fight to marijua  itself i mean even if he took down a few  celestial dragons on this island the  battle to overthrow the world government  would be far from over finally why would  garp and goldie roger risk their lives  to protect a bunch of celestial dragons  from zebek i mean even if we say that  garp did it because he was obligated to  do so by his position  roger certainly had no obligation to  protect the world nobles in my opinion  all of this only makes sense if we  insert a missing piece that ties it all  together  a secret weapon of incredible power  perhaps even one of the ancient weapons  themselves the celestial dragons may  have gone to god valley to either locate  or test a game-changing overpowered  weapon since that is something that they  definitely wouldn't do anywhere near  their holy land zebek may have attacked  because he wanted to steal this weapon  and use it to bring down the world  government and become king of the world  roger and garp decided that allowing  zebek to steal the weapon was just too  dangerous so they teamed up to stop him  not because they wanted to protect the  celestial dragons but because they  wanted to protect the rest of the world  from zebek the world government covered  everything up not only because they  didn't want the world to know that roger  helped them but also because they didn't  want anyone to find out about this  ultimate weapon in fact they may have  even used the weapon to wipe god valley  out of existence oh and back when  doflamingo said that he knows about the  hidden treasure of marijuana he may have  been referring to this very weapon so  the reason why blackbeard's photo  appears alongside the photos of  shirahoshi vivi and luffy could be  because he found out about this top  secret weapon and is trying to retrieve  it or maybe he managed to retrieve it  already and that is why his devil fruit  is so unique and why he can use more  than one devil fruit at the same time  the yami yami no me may itself be this  secret weapon and just like the nika  fruit its true name and true nature may  be something completely different from  what we initially thought we actually  have an entire video here on the channel  about the possibility that the yami yami  know me is actually a mythical zone  devil fruit just like luffy's so if you  want to check that out i will link it in  the description at any rate if my theory  about a secret weapon at god valley is  correct then the big question is what  was this weapon was it the yamami itself  was it one of the three known ancient  weapons was it a fourth secret agent  weapon or was it something else  attacking 101 had an interesting theory  about god valley maybe being the  homeland of real dragons the celestial  dragons went there in order to acquire  and train their dragons and zebek tried  to take control of all the dragons in  order to use them to attack marijuana  from the air this is a fascinating  theory although if true i certainly hope  that at least some of the dragons  survived it would kind of suck if we got  an epic god valley flashback only to  learn that yup all those cool dragons  died and we'll never see them again just  a side note subscribing to teching 101  is basically a requirement for every  die-hard one-piece fan and i strongly  recommend it personally i really like  the idea of the four photos that emu was  holding representing four ancient  weapons one of which may be so secret  that hardly anyone even knows about it  if i were to guess what a fourth ancient  weapon might be i would say chaos also  known as the great void that predates  all other existence even the existence  of the gods themselves in greek  mythology chaos is what gave birth to  everything else including darkness  itself so there's a connection to the  yamiyami know me also if anything could  make an entire island just disappear  into the void it would certainly be the  power of chaos  historically chaos has been visually  represented by a variety of symbols  including a sun-like sphere with an eye  hands and feet a serpent or dragon and  various types of spirals chaos could be  directly related to the true 